{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109095345272-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109103511\"/><p>大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（9日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該4處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該4處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.617576+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T01:53:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:09.264321+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:45.062773+00:00","content_hash":"cf5e89bc626a91fe619794aa9d712133de4ac745c93661cd93acf1ce46d42d19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.617576+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}